- turn: \`boundary\`
- iteration: \`3\`
- epic: \`auth\`
- intent: \`/goal/intent.md\`
- plan: \`/goal/epics/auth.md\` (your epic plan; edit this file)
- parent plan: \`/goal/plan.md\` (read-only)
- goal checkout: \`/worktrees/demo\`
- context pack: \`/goal/iterations/3/epics/auth/context-pack.md\`
- previous-launch digest: \`/goal/iterations/3/epics/auth/digest.md\` (empty before this epic's first launch)
- outcome path: \`/goal/records/00048-i3-subarchitect-r1/outcome.yaml\`
"
